  "implementation": "Only mkdir retains create:true in creationFileSystem capabilityFor mode hint. Creating-open uses original options generic query and preserves permissionless no-mode/reference path, unknownlegacy0600, calleroption immutability and signal/error identity. No capability cache, DeviceFS change, callerpreflight change, backendacquisition change or fixture rewrite.",
  "controls": [
    "Two refined creating-open ifMissing/exclusive controls require generic query (no own create), original query optionreference, new forwarded mode0600 without mutating caller.",
    "Four permissions:false/unknown controls verify omittedmode/originalreference versus implicitmode600/copy.",
    "Two explicitmode640 controls preserve original options and skip query.",
    "Two query-error/cancellation controls each cover EACCES and null/false/0/empty/NaN midquery aborts plus all five falsey preaborts with no acquisition.",
    "Eighteen actual backend controls cover missingfinal/mountedfinal, missingparent/mountedparent, readonlyview/readonlymount, null device/devicechild/device directory, under ifMissing/exclusive.",
    "Two actual Shell mode controls preserve caller create:true preflight count1 and rootstatcount1 for ifMissing; exclusive skips callercreatingpreflight and has rootstatcount0; exact xbytes and mode600.",
    "Six actual Shell device diagnostic controls retain exact source/stdout/stderr/exitcode for normal and noclobber /dev, /dev/null and devicechild."
  ],
  "intentionalPrivateDiagnosticChange": "Direct private creationFileSystem /dev creating open formerly failed EISDIR in modehint creatingquery; generic hint now lets authoritative DeviceFS.open report ENOTSUP. Actual Shell six maintained device diagnostics unchanged (including Permissiondenied normal/dev and exclusiveunsupported/dev).",
  "setupFailuresPreserved": [
    "First maintainedred used context.mock on absent MemoryFS.capabilitiesFor; two controls setupfailed. Corrected faithful Proxy adds optional pathquery.",
    "Second red had unregistered printf. Corrected Shell plugin uses existing agentCommands. Qualified red has six validated assertions, no setupfailures."
  ],
